<!-- Million Module March - LADDER mode with surging metering.
     A 2x4x4 block (32 catoms) marches +x at a wall whose opening is a 5x5 square
     tunnel (usable 3x3 after clearance). The APF infers mode=ladder (constricted
     in both perpendicular axes); the box narrows to a 3x3 column and surging
     meters the body through. clearance="1"; obstacles are never pivots. -->

